description:
The topic, how the patient or the attendant was guided and the material used; signed with the author's stamp and
never edited (record a correct one after a wrong one). `NOT_FOUND` for an unknown patient or consultation;
`VALIDATION_ERROR` for a consultation of another patient, or a leaflet or video without its material;
`REFERENCE_NOT_FOUND` for an unknown or retired material.

